{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Move with the music, take over the grid!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/8d1b6e91391b18b58bff3a3d38d64e58.poster.avif?t=1768864325\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/8d1b6e91391b18b58bff3a3d38d64e58.webm?t=1768864325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/8d1b6e91391b18b58bff3a3d38d64e58.mp4?t=1768864325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no lanes or notes, find your own path on a 6x6 grid. Each beat brings a new threat, and every measure of music is a test of your mastery!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Prove your mastery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From geometric traps to straight line bullets, learn every track to turn chaos into a perfect combo. See where you stand among the global player base in the Rank mode. Fight for your place in the Top 1% of Engineers. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 The chase</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/51f674873e9066bf1fb3a9afbc364d2c.poster.avif?t=1768864325\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/51f674873e9066bf1fb3a9afbc364d2c.webm?t=1768864325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/51f674873e9066bf1fb3a9afbc364d2c.mp4?t=1768864325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a breath between beats with an illustrated story mode. Each chapter unfolds through page-by-page prose, following Klare, a Soul Rose Engineer caught between Iris, a Phantom Hunter, and Vignette, a mysterious thief.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Your stage your rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a curated selection of piano and electronic tracks from talented artists with varying difficulties. Whether you\u2019re here for the hardcore bullet-hell inspired challenge or just to vibe, adjustable difficulties and modes let you find your zone. But go further and use the built-in beatmap editor to create your custom stages and share!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/7f850f87548996c4c449d3ef50eb3364.poster.avif?t=1768864325\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/7f850f87548996c4c449d3ef50eb3364.webm?t=1768864325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/7f850f87548996c4c449d3ef50eb3364.mp4?t=1768864325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage is set. <strong>Wishlist Asterika today!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690850?t=1768864325","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690850?t=1768864325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/3a99f87270a606d65180a30b486d68264d86ae79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768864325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/3a99f87270a606d65180a30b486d68264d86ae79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768864325","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id